    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You are trained in Sith military fighting techniques, giving you an advantage in melee combat. This training is generally given to rank and file military members of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Sith_Empire\" title=\"The Sith Empire\">The Sith Empire</a> regardless of their Force training.</p><p><b>Effect:</b> Once per encounter, as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reaction</a> when you reduce a target to 0 Hit Points or deal damage that exceeds the target's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Damage_Threshold\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage Threshold\">Damage Threshold</a>, you can activate this Feat to cause all enemies within 6 squares of that target to take a -2 penalty to all <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Defenses\" title=\"Defenses\">Defenses</a> until the end of your next turn. This is a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Mind-Affecting\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mind-Affecting\">Mind-Affecting</a> effect.</p>",
